lines += ['',f'Original media totals {total/1e6:.1f} MB. Web delivery media, including the separate silent hero copy, totals {web/1e6:.1f} MB. Original files remain in their original folder.','', '## Curation and presentation','', '- `Entertainment7.m4v` / **Worlds in motion**: lead hero footage and featured full-length edit; 4:3. The silent hero copy uses the complete edit, not a fabricated combined reel.','- `Promotional.mp4` / **Street Snitch / App promo**: animated phone and interface presentation. The title identifies the product visible in the footage; it makes no client or employment claim.','- `Fitness.mp4` / **Built in motion**: portrait training footage and typography.','- `Entertainment6.mp4` / **Animated dimensions**: animation footage, geometric frames, kinetic type.','- All remaining videos appear in the gallery. Every item opens in the same aspect-preserving player; the project array in `js/projects.js` defines the presentation order.','- Categories: Entertainment (9), Logo animation (6), Promotional (1), Fitness (1), UGC (2).','- The full descriptions and techniques are based on visible frames plus résumé-supported capabilities. No specific software is attributed to an individual video without per-project evidence.','- All project names are descriptive working titles. The source-to-title mapping is recorded in `js/projects.js` and `docs/prepare_media.py`.','', '## Verified résumé information','', 'Source: `D:\\Documents\\C.V\\Daniel_Rawda_Resume_Video_Editing.pdf` (one page), fully extracted and visually inspected. An unchanged download copy is stored at `assets/documents/daniel-rawda-resume.pdf`.','', '- Daniel Wissam Rawda; public portfolio name Daniel Rawda.','- Video Editor & Motion Graphics Designer; VFX and AI-driven content production.','- Lebanon; danielrawda98@gmail.com; +961 79 149 862; LinkedIn `/in/daniel-rawda-a79b09390`.','- Over four years of short-form and cinematic content experience.','- Technical Video Editor & Digital Content Creator, Freelance / Self-Employed, Lebanon, October 2022–Present.','- Video Editing & Graphic Design Intern, CIS College, Khalde, Lebanon, June–August 2022.','- BSc in Computer Science, University of Balamand, graduated June 2026.','- Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects, Photoshop, CapCut.','- Motion graphics, logo animation, kinetic typography, VFX, particle effects, 3D camera tracking and animation, compositing, color grading, audio-video synchronization, pacing and retiming.','- ElevenLabs, HeyGen, Adobe Firefly, Seedance, Google Omni Flash; avatar generation, lip-sync rendering, custom scripting, automated asset pipelines.','- Arabic (native), English (advanced).','- Training and certifications are listed in the website using the résumé’s course names and providers. No proficiency percentages are invented.','', '## Portrait','', 'The actual supplied `LinkedinProfile.png` is used as `assets/images/daniel-portrait.webp`. It is resized and encoded for delivery. Facial features and identity are unchanged; the site applies a mild CSS saturation treatment that clears on hover.','', '## Creative direction','', 'Near-black editorial canvas; Syne display type and DM Sans UI; cyan as the principal accent, indigo and magenta confined to timeline details. The section sequence moves from footage to collection, personal introduction, toolkit, experience, education, process and contact. Motion uses short opacity/transform reveals, a restrained particle network and editing-inspired timelines. Video interaction takes priority over decoration.','', '## Delivery decisions','', '- Buildless HTML, CSS and ES modules; no client framework or runtime dependency.','- H.264 / yuv420p MP4 with AAC audio and fast-start metadata for browser compatibility. CRF 21; width capped at 1080 pixels; source frame rates retained. Tall frames are never stretched. Larger logo studies are downscaled for web delivery.','- WebP posters are extracted from actual video frames. No substitute stock images or artificial portrait are used.','- Only the hero video may load automatically. The featured player and gallery videos load on intentional play/hover. At most one card preview is active; previews pause and release their sources when out of view.','- Reduced motion and Save-Data disable hero autoplay and card previews. All explicit playback remains available.','- Local preview supports HTTP byte ranges for seeking.','', '## Items for Daniel to confirm','', '1. Preferred final public project names; filenames do not supply official titles.','2. Whether Worlds in motion should remain the featured cut, or whether a dedicated showreel will be supplied later.','3. Final domain before adding absolute canonical and Open Graph URLs. The current metadata is deployment-neutral.','', 'The site is intentionally local. No hosting account, Site registration, repository push or public deployment was created.']
